<title>USA: INSIGHT - Dlr/mark grip on 1.84 bullish signal.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Dlr/mark grip on 1.84 bullish signal.</headline>
<text>
<p>DLR* *S/TERM RANGE  *SUPPORT *RESTNCE *RSI-14 *MA-8   *MA-13</p>
<p>DEM* *1.8210/1.8550 *1.8315  *1.8460  *54 pct *1.8427 *1.8538</p>
<p>YEN* *116.30/119.50 *117.90  *118.70  *57 pct *116.75 *117.43</p>
<p>------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET---------Aug 19-------------</p>
<p>*Dlr/mark finish above 1.84 would signal move to 1.8460/80 area, 50 pct retrace of downmove from cycle top 1.8913 to Mon low 1.8050. Push to recent 1.8465/75 highs seen fueling 1.87+.</p>
<p>*Dlr/yen bulls eye big figure move beyond 119 upon near-term push to 118.55/70. Some momentum studies suggest break higher, but failure of upmove within 48 hours portends drop to 117.20 or 116.30, current range bottom. Trading range seen following.</p>
</text>
